<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Johor Port '96 net up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Johor Port '96 net up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  18.8   vs	 15.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		    194.7   vs	172.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     69.6   vs	 68.2</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less   2.0   vs  less 20.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		   55.1   vs	 43.7</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  6.0   vs	  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Johor Port Berhad is a container port that operates in Malaysia's southern-most state of Johor.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
